    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ac218e7f2b183f267ae8de66777e0d4d.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ac218e7f2b183f267ae8de66777e0d4d.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ac218e7f2b183f267ae8de66777e0d4d.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to \u201cDigital Miners\u201d, where your skills and knowledge are the keys to unimaginable riches and power. Step into the role of a seasoned miner, exploring a vast world filled with hidden treasures, mysterious mentors, and competitive guilds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ea7944c5982cea05a9407c3b06de9f86.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ea7944c5982cea05a9407c3b06de9f86.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ea7944c5982cea05a9407c3b06de9f86.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Rich, Dynamic World </strong><br>Discover a world teeming with valuable resources and hidden secrets. Traverse expansive lands to find the perfect spot to settle. Each plot holds the potential for immense wealth\u2014it's up to you to harness it. <br><br><strong>Join a Guild </strong><br>Whether you're new or just prefer teamwork, joining a guild is a fantastic way to gain easy profits. Collaborate to build impressive structures, set up defenses, and grow stronger together. Cooperation is the key to success. <br><br><strong>Dynamic Marketplace </strong><br>Mining isn't everything; trading is crucial too! Exchange your resources, artifacts, and premium lands. Smart trading and investment strategies can quickly enhance your wealth and expand your empire. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/864b7e95c4ef5b8e701eab58091d58fc.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/864b7e95c4ef5b8e701eab58091d58fc.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/864b7e95c4ef5b8e701eab58091d58fc.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Strategic Resource Management </strong><br>Mining is just the beginning. Wise management of your resources is essential! Decide the order of your constructions, trading, and reinforcements. Maximize your mining output and economic gains.<br><br><strong>Upgrade Your Equipment </strong><br>To excel in mining, you need superior equipment. Boost your operations with powerful excavators, advanced mining facilities, and more. Every upgrade brings you closer to dominating the mining world. \ud83d\ude80<br><br><strong>Mysterious Mentors </strong><br>Unlock the secrets of the world with the help of mysterious mentors. They'll guide you through challenging quests, helping you uncover ancient lore and powerful artifacts. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/de68a357c469590467ac4f403ebdb37d.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/de68a357c469590467ac4f403ebdb37d.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/de68a357c469590467ac4f403ebdb37d.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Exciting Community Events! </strong><br>At Digital Miners, we believe in the power of our community. Experience exciting and frequent events created by our developers, where you can earn incredible rewards. Show off your status as one of the elite Digital Hunters and join in the fun!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ac218e7f2b183f267ae8de66777e0d4d.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ac218e7f2b183f267ae8de66777e0d4d.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ac218e7f2b183f267ae8de66777e0d4d.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to \u201cDigital Miners\u201d, where your skills and knowledge are the keys to unimaginable riches and power. Step into the role of a seasoned miner, exploring a vast world filled with hidden treasures, mysterious mentors, and competitive guilds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ea7944c5982cea05a9407c3b06de9f86.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ea7944c5982cea05a9407c3b06de9f86.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/ea7944c5982cea05a9407c3b06de9f86.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Rich, Dynamic World </strong><br>Discover a world teeming with valuable resources and hidden secrets. Traverse expansive lands to find the perfect spot to settle. Each plot holds the potential for immense wealth\u2014it's up to you to harness it. <br><br><strong>Join a Guild </strong><br>Whether you're new or just prefer teamwork, joining a guild is a fantastic way to gain easy profits. Collaborate to build impressive structures, set up defenses, and grow stronger together. Cooperation is the key to success. <br><br><strong>Dynamic Marketplace </strong><br>Mining isn't everything; trading is crucial too! Exchange your resources, artifacts, and premium lands. Smart trading and investment strategies can quickly enhance your wealth and expand your empire. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/864b7e95c4ef5b8e701eab58091d58fc.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/864b7e95c4ef5b8e701eab58091d58fc.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/864b7e95c4ef5b8e701eab58091d58fc.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Strategic Resource Management </strong><br>Mining is just the beginning. Wise management of your resources is essential! Decide the order of your constructions, trading, and reinforcements. Maximize your mining output and economic gains.<br><br><strong>Upgrade Your Equipment </strong><br>To excel in mining, you need superior equipment. Boost your operations with powerful excavators, advanced mining facilities, and more. Every upgrade brings you closer to dominating the mining world. \ud83d\ude80<br><br><strong>Mysterious Mentors </strong><br>Unlock the secrets of the world with the help of mysterious mentors. They'll guide you through challenging quests, helping you uncover ancient lore and powerful artifacts. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/de68a357c469590467ac4f403ebdb37d.poster.avif?t=1723552003\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/de68a357c469590467ac4f403ebdb37d.webm?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110290/extras/de68a357c469590467ac4f403ebdb37d.mp4?t=1723552003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Exciting Community Events! </strong><br>At Digital Miners, we believe in the power of our community. Experience exciting and frequent events created by our developers, where you can earn incredible rewards. Show off your status as one of the elite Digital Hunters and join in the fun!",
